              <div className="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
                <h3 className="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2 pb-2 border-b border-gray-50">
                   <span className="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-purple-100 text-purple-600 flex items-center justify-center text-sm">
                    <svg className="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                  </span>
                  Nội dung màn hình chào
